  <project_license>MIT</project_license>
  <name>UsTaxes</name>
  <summary>Free, open-source tax filing application for US federal and state taxes</summary>
  <description>
    <p>
      UsTaxes is a free, open-source tax filing application that can be used to file the Federal 1040 form. 
      It is provided free of charge and requires no sharing of personal data.
    </p>
    <p>Features:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Supports Form 1040 and various schedules</li>
      <li>Handles income from W2, 1099-INT, 1099-DIV, 1099-B, 1098-E, 1099-R, and SSA-1099</li>
      <li>Supports credits for children and other dependents</li>
      <li>Supports earned income credit</li>
      <li>Partial support for state returns (Illinois)</li>
      <li>All data stays on your computer - no personal information is shared</li>
    </ul>
  </description>
  <url type="homepage">https://ustaxes.org/</url>
